OL,3,ARussell Brand accusers 'haunted' for
OL,4,Ayears by alleged crimes, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome of the women in Russell Brand's
OL,7,Frape and sexual assault case have been
OL,8,F"haunted" for years by what they allege
OL,9,Fhe did to them, jurors have been told.
OL,11,FIn her closing speech at London's
OL,12,FSouthwark Crown Court on Friday,
OL,13,Fprosecutor Reil Karmy-Jones KC said the
OL,14,Fwomen had "nothing to gain" from coming
OL,15,Fforward apart from "some closure".
OL,17,FSpeaking for the defence, Polly Dyer
OL,18,Ftold jurors Brand had pleaded guilty
OL,19,Fand been fined over possession of
OL,20,Fcannabis in 1995, but had no other
OL,21,F"convictions, cautions, reprimands or
OL,22,Fwarnings".
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/18
