OL,3,ASir Ian McKellen leads tributes to
OL,4,A'beloved actor' Sir Patrick Stewart
OL,5,Aafter his death at 86
OL,6,
OL,7,FSir Ian McKellen has led tributes to
OL,8,FSir Patrick Stewart following his death
OL,9,Fat the age of 86, calling him "the most
OL,10,Frespected and beloved actor of his
OL,11,Fgeneration".
OL,13,FTributes to the renowned British actor
OL,14,Fhave poured in since his death at his
OL,15,FLos Angeles home after "a brief and
OL,16,Fpoignant journey" with Alzheimer's
OL,17,Fdisease and Lewy Body Dementia was
OL,18,Fannounced on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
